# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# ─────────────────────────── Dependencies ───────────────────────────
# No leading slash → matches node_modules anywhere (incl. nested projects/*).
node_modules/
/.pnp
.pnp.js
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/sdks
!.yarn/versions

# ─────────────────────────── Build output ───────────────────────────
.next/
out/
build/
dist/
/coverage

# ───────────────────────── Secrets / env vars ───────────────────────
# Never commit real credentials or API keys. Only *.example templates are kept.
.env
.env.*
*.local
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

# Keys / certificates
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_dsa
*.cert
secrets.json
credentials.json

# ─────────────────────────── Documentation ──────────────────────────
# Ignore loose markdown notes/guides, but keep the project README tracked.
*.md
!README.md

# ───────────────────────────── Logs ─────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# ───────────────────────── Editor / OS files ────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
*.swo

# ─────────────────────────── TypeScript ─────────────────────────────
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# ──────────────────────────── Deployment ────────────────────────────
.vercel
.netlify
